{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"aaron-stanford","name":"Aaron Stanford","birthDate":"1976-12-27","birthPlace":"Westford, Massachusetts, USA","bio":"Aaron Stanford (born December 27, 1976) is an American actor known for his roles as Pyro in the X-Men films X2 (2003), X-Men: The Last Stand (2006) and Deadpool & Wolverine (2024), and Doug in the remake of The Hills Have Eyes(2006). On television, he also starred as Birkhoff in Nikita (2010–2013) and as James Cole in 12 Monkeys (2015–2018), based on the 1995 film of the same name.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Aaron Stanford, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:56:18+00:00","tmdbId":11022,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/11022","credits":[{"id":"deadpool-wolverine","title":"Deadpool & Wolverine","character":"Pyro","characterFa":"پیرو"},{"id":"x2","title":"X2: X-Men United","character":"John Allerdyce / Pyro","characterFa":"جان آلردایس / پیرو"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/aaron-stanford.webp","filmography":[{"name":"On The Line","year":2026,"character":"Glenn","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qojmZkbyHbapaAtTysaCXo5wfxE.jpg"},{"name":"CIA","year":2026,"character":"Robert Davis","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fEXauqIabKrMPQ2lVTHKdrkrR4Z.jpg"},{"name":"Deadpool & Wolverine","year":2024,"character":"Pyro","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg","characterFa":"پیرو"},{"name":"Tracker","year":2024,"character":"Ricky","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/otula4h1ITZ0eV84eg7Lb8u614C.jpg"},{"name":"Finestkind","year":2023,"character":"Skeemo","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/90D6sXfbXKhDpd4S1cHICdAe8VD.jpg"},{"name":"Kepley","year":2021,"character":"David Logan","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1wlMykqaF2q0PbQM8LdAtX6F54c.jpg"},{"n